c='integration.outbound_timeouts';visuals[c]=graph({'total':'asyncio.timeout — total elapsed-work boundary','pool':'Pool wait → PoolTimeout','connect':'Connection wait → ConnectTimeout','read':'Wait for each response chunk → ReadTimeout','write':'Wait for each sent chunk → WriteTimeout','chunks':'Successive chunks within read limit can exceed that limit in total elapsed time','io':'Finite HTTPX client/request timeout; None disables enforcement','outside':'Outside asyncio.timeout: TimeoutError'},[('io','pool','Wait limit'),('io','connect','Wait limit'),('io','read','Per-chunk wait limit'),('io','write','Per-chunk wait limit'),('read','chunks','Not a total deadline'),('total','io','Separate total-work boundary'),('total','outside','Cancellation converted outside context')],'A finite HTTPX timeout limits pool, connection and per-chunk read/write waits. A separate asyncio.timeout bounds total elapsed work and raises TimeoutError outside its context.',kind='container')
